@HostAddress = http://localhost:5287

### 1. [Create] 寫入 Log（推入佇列）
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "service": "order-service",
  "level": "Information",
  "message": "Payment process completed for order #1001",
  "traceId": "trace-http-001"
}

### 2. [Read] 依關鍵字與服務搜尋 Logs
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/logs?service=order-service&keyword=Payment
Accept: application/json

### 3. [Read] 依 ID 取得單筆 Log (請替換為實際 _id)
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/logs/K67LLaABbPQ5FnXdTodm
Accept: application/json

### 4. [Update] 更新 Log 訊息 (請替換為實際底層索引與 _id)
PUT {{HostAddress}}/api/logs/.ds-logs-app-prod-2026.08.23-000001/K67LLaABbPQ5FnXdTodm
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Payment process completed and audited"
}

### 5. [Delete] 刪除 Log (請替換為實際底層索引與 _id)
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/api/logs/.ds-logs-app-prod-2026.08.23-000001/K67LLaABbPQ5FnXdTodm

### 6. [Create] 手動按日索引模式：寫入 Log
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/daily-index/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "service": "shipping-service",
  "level": "Warning",
  "message": "Shipping delay detected for order #1002",
  "traceId": "trace-http-daily-001"
}

### 7. [Read] 手動按日索引模式：跨日搜尋 Logs
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/daily-index/logs?service=shipping-service&keyword=Shipping
Accept: application/json
